---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Henry Calligraphy"
  description="Meet Isha Henry-Hament, professional copperplate calligrapher based in Breda, the Netherlands."
>
  <section class="border-b border-foreground/15">
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1fr] md:items-center"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/2026_Brandshoot-Isha-34.jpg"
        alt="Isha Henry-Hament, calligrapher and founder of Henry Calligraphy"
        class="aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover object-top sm:aspect-auto sm:h-96 md:h-[32rem]"
      />
      <div>
        <p class="font-sans text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-muted-foreground">
          About me
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">
          My name is Isha Henry-Hament.
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <p>
            I'm 32 years old and a professional calligrapher based in Breda, the Netherlands. The
            name "Henry Calligraphy" is inspired by our little family name.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm a mother of two and a former politician who is combining her corporate job with her
            passion for lettering. I hold a Bachelor's degree in Business and Languages, as well as
            a Master's in International Relations and Diplomacy.
          </p>
          <p>
            I previously served as a city council member and bring over 10 years of experience in
            sales and business development, having lived and worked in Hong Kong, Paris, Spain, and
            The Netherlands.
          </p>
          <p>
            With a Tanzanian and Dutch background, I identify as multicultural—shaped by different
            places, perspectives, and experiences. The consistent thread throughout my life? The
            belief that words matter; your message matters, and how you convey it matters just as
            much.
          </p>
          <p>
            As AI and digitalisation continue to reshape our world, there is a growing appreciation
            for the authenticity of craftsmanship.
          </p>
          <p>
            I practice copperplate calligraphy and I am passionate about sharing the beauty of
            bespoke calligraphy with the world. A true luxury!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
